# rasayan — src/jak_stat.cyr: Rust 1.2.0's JAK-STAT tests, ported
# Stdlib auto-included via cyrius.cyml
#
# The 12 unit tests of `jak_stat.rs` and the 2 integration tests (tests/integration.rs) that call only the pathway, as
# they are written; tests/golden/jak_stat.tsv checks every method, single tick and trajectory besides. Beyond them:
# the trace event and every codec's round trip.

